OL,3,GNEWSASenior leaders at NHS Grampian
OL,4,Acriticised in health watchdog's damning
OL,5,Areport
OL,6,
OL,7,FA healthcare watchdog has found "major
OL,8,Fdeficiencies" in the handling of the
OL,9,Fdeath of a patient during surgery,
OL,10,Ffollowing a damning report into
OL,11,Ffailures by senior leadership at NHS
OL,12,FGrampian.
OL,14,FHealthcare Improvement Scotland (HIS)
OL,15,Frevealed that a failure to learn from
OL,16,Fmistakes had caused "repeated and
OL,17,Favoidable harm" to patients.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
