OL,3,GNEWSASenior leaders at NHS Grampian
OL,4,Acriticised in health watchdog's damning
OL,5,Areport
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt also said it had lost confidence in
OL,8,FNHS Grampian's management to deliver
OL,9,Freliable and consistent information
OL,10,Fafter it was ordered to halt all
OL,11,Fpaediatric surgery at Dr Gray's
OL,12,FHospital in Elgin but continued to
OL,13,Foperate on some children until early
OL,14,FAugust.
OL,16,FNHS Grampian chief executive Laura
OL,17,FSkaife-Knight said the board accepted
OL,18,Fthe findings and apologised to
OL,19,Fpatients.
